    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Milīmo ya bagabīji na Balawī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Alooni, “Ūlū būbi bose bose wilonga ū mu kaīle ka milīmo ya ng'wipandī lyeela, ū wakūbalīlwa būkenaagūji akūbiza bebe na a bitūnja bako, hamò nī numba ya lūganda lwa ng'wing'we. Alīyo ūlū wilonga būbi bose bose mu milīmo ya būgabīji, ū wakūbalīlwa būkenaagūji akūbiza bebe na a bitūnja bako dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī haha benhage a Balawī biyo, a ba lūganda lwako, bize badimane nang'ho, bayūkūgunanha ū bebe na a bitūnja bako ū mu milīmo ya ng'wiheema lya būkaanīji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nīmo gwabo a benabo gūlī kūkūgunanha ū bebe, nīyo bakwīyīta pyī ī milīmo ya ng'wiheema, alīyo batī ba kūsheegeela ī shiseme sha ng'wipandī lyeela, nūūlū ū ng'walīlo yaya ū kūgweegeela; nguno ūlū yūja gīko mukūcha pye, ū bebe na a boi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakūbiza mu būsangī būmò nang'ho, na bakūyūlīlang'hana ī liheema lya kwibilingīla, hamò na kwīlonja pyī ī milīmo ya ng'wiheema. Atīho ūngī ose ose wa kwegeela aho ūlītūmamīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī milīmo ya ng'wipandī lyeela nī ya ha ng'walīlo, ūkwībeeja bebe pyī ī yenīyo, batizūpelanīlwa hangī a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Balawī biyo naabakomije ū kūfuma ū mu Baisilaeli, nūkwinha bebe gīt'inong'ho lyeela kūlī SEEBA, kūlwa būtūmami wa ng'wiheema lya kwibilingīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo pyī ī milīmo ya būgabīji īyo īkīītagwa ha ng'walīlo, nū kū mpīndo y'isenge, ī yenīyo ya kūbeejiwa na bebe dūhū hamò na bitūnja bako. Ū bebe nalīkwinha ū nīmo gwa būgabīji gītī inong'ho. Ūngī ose ose ūyo wegeela a hipandī lyeela shiigelile abūlagwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shakwinha kūlwa bagabīji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Alooni, “Managa gīkī, nakwinhaga nīmo gwa kūshilang'hana ī shakwinha īsho nakafunījiagwa nene, ī shakwinha sheela īsho Baisilaeli bakaninhaga nene, pyī ī shose nakwinhaga bebe hamò na bitūnja bako; ū gwenūyo ngabo gwako gwa shikū jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī shitambò īsho shilī sheela no no no, īsho shikasaagaga ha kūpemva mu moto shilī shako. Pyī ī shakwinha īsho bakanenhelaga nene gīkī shilī sheela no no no, shibize sha būsu, nūūlū sha kūfunyiwa kūlwa shibi, nūūlū kūlwa būkenaagūji, pyī ī shose shilī shako, hamò na bitūnja bako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkūshilya ūlī ng'wipandī lyeela no no no, būlī ngosha akūshilya; ī shoi shilī sheela ū kūlī bebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na shingī shiishi īsho shilī shako: Būlī shene īsho shikatūūlagwa ha mhūjo kūfuma mu shitambò sha kūyengeejiwa, īsho Baisilaeli bakafunyaga. Ī shenīshi nasho nalīkwinha bebe hamò na bitūnja bako, na a bashīke bako; ū gwenūyo gūlī ngabo gwako gwa būlī lūshikū. Būlī ng'wene ū mu kaya yako ūyo atī na būsoso adūgije ū kūshilya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīkwinha bebe na a maguta pye a gose a gawiza no no no, a ga mizeituni; nī divai ī yawiza, pye nī shilīwa īsho bakamfunījaga SEEBA kūbiza matwajo ga kwandya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo pye a matwajo ga kwandya ga sī ayo bakamfunījaga SEEBA gakūbiza gako. Būlī ng'wene ū mu numba yako ūyo atī na būsoso adūgije ū kūshilya ī shenīsho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pyī ī shikolo sha mu sī ya Isilaeli īsho shafunyiwa kūbiza sha ng'wa SEEBA shilī shako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mbyalwa ja kwandya ījo jikafunyiagwa kūbiza ja ng'wa SEEBA jilī jaako, būlī ntugo ū gwa kūlugūla nda ya ng'wa ninaago gūlī gwako; na a bagosha a babyalwa ba kwandya ū mu banhū balī bako. Alīyo a babyalwa ba kwandya ba banhū ūkūbakomoola; nī mbyalwa ja kwandya ū mu mitugo ījo jitigeleelilwe kūfunyiwa kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA najo ūkūjikomoola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lya kūjikomoola ī mbyalwa ja kwandya, līkūbiza ūlū jūshisha ng'weji ngima kūfuma kūbyalwa. Ū mpango gwa kūshikomoola ī shikolo gūlī shekeeli itanò ja feza, kūlenganīla nū mpango gwa shekeeli ya ng'wipandī lyeela, īyo īlī na mpango gwa gulamu ikūmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī mbyalwa ja kwandya ī ja ng'ombe nī ja ng'holo hamò na ja mbūli, ī jenījo yaya ū kūjikomoola nguno jilī neela. A mininga gaajo ūkūgita ha ng'walīlo, nī nyama jaajo ūjipembe mu moto kūbiza shitambò sha kūpemva, kūlwa ng'waso gwawiza kūlī SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nyama ja mitugo jenījo jilī jaako, gīt'ūmo shilī ī shidali īsho shikafunyiagwa kūbiza shitambò sha kūyengeejiwa, nī litango lya kū būlyo, īlo nalyo līlī lyako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī shakwinha sheela īsho Baisilaeli bakamfunījaga SEEBA naakwinhaga bebe hamò na bitūnja bako, na a bashīke bako; ū gwenūyo gūlī ngabo gwako gwa būlī lūshikū. Ī lyenīlo līlī ilagane lya munhu lya būja na būja ha gatī ya ng'wa SEEBA nū bebe nī shibyalīlwe shako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Alooni, ‘Ū bebe ūtūbiza na wingīji ū mu Baisilaeli, nūūlū ūtūbiza na ngabo hamò nabo; nguno ū ngabo gwako ū mu Baisilaeli gūlī kūlī nene, nū wingīji wako būkūfuma kūlī nene.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Zaka kwinhwa Balawī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī Zaka ja Baisilaeli ī jose naabinhaga Balawī kūbiza wingīji wabo kūlwa nguno ya būtūmami wabo ūbo bakwītaga ng'wiheema lya kwibilingīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwandīja haha a Baisilaeli yaya ū kwegeela a h'iheema lya kwibilingīla, batizingīla mu kwihīga bakacha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būtūmami wa ng'wiheema lya kwibilingīla būkwītwa na Balawī, ī mihayo ya ng'wene īlī ha sīlīlī ya būlang'hani wabo. Ī shenīshi shilī shilagīlo sha būja na būja nū kū shibyalīlwe īsho shiliza. A Balawī batanukūla wingīji hamò na a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ha ng'wanya gwaho, a Balawī naabinhaga ī Zaka ījo Baisilaeli bakeenhaga kūlī SEEBA kūbiza shakwinha. H'ī nguno yene nalīhaya gīkī, a boi batūbiza na wingīji hamò na a Baisilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Balawī kūfunya zaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lūngalūngaga na a Balawī ūbawīle gīkī, “Ūlū ng'wanukūla kūfuma ū kū Baisilaeli ī Zaka īyo naang'winhaga kūbiza wingīji wing'we, shing'wigeleelilwe ning'we kūfunya Zaka ībize shakwinha kūlī SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shakwinha shing'we shikūbalwa kūbiza gītī shilīīwa sha kūfuma ha lūbūūga lwa kūtūlīla, nūūlū gītī minzī ga mizabibu ga kūfuma ng'wikamīlo lya mizabibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu gīko na a bing'we mukūfunya shakwinha ū kūlī SEEBA, ū kūfuma ū mu Zaka ījo mukwanukūlaga kūfuma kū Baisilaeli. Ū mu Zaka jenījo, līlīmo ibudīka lya ng'wa SEEBA, īlo shiing'wigeleelilwe mung'winhe ngabīji Alooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shing'wigeleelilwe kūmfunīja ū SEEBA ī shakwinha īsho shilī shawiza no no no, īsho shifumile mu shakwinha shose īsho mukanukūlaga kūfuma kū Baisilaeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū bawīlage a Balawī gīkī, “Ūlū ng'ūfunya shakwinha ī shawiza no no no, shikūbalwa gītī ng'wafunyaga shilīwa kūfuma ha lūbūūga lwa kūtūlīla, nūūlū kūfuma ng'wikamīlo lya mizabibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īsho shikūsaaga mukūlya hamò nī kaya jing'we, hose hose ūko mukūbiza; nguno ī yenīyo hī mheela ying'we kūlwa būtūmami wing'we, ū ng'wiheema lya kwibilingīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ng'ūfunya ī shakwinha ī shawiza no no no kūfuma ū mu shakwinha īsho mukūpandīkaga, mutūūbalīlwa būhūbi ū mu mhayo gwenūyo; ū mu gīko mutūbiza mulīshisosohaja ī shakwinha īsho Baisilaeli bakafunyaga, nūūlū kūcha mutūūcha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
